[{"client_msg_id":"0e24389f-86b8-4ce2-8643-114ef9b35db6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Semantic Tokens というのは v3.16 でサポートされた新しいプロトコルのようですね。","ts":"1625404634.233500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jrv3q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a4ce3cc-ffa9-477a-bc91-6faa6e93ebca","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"しかしガイドにある \"Semantic token provider\" てのは別に LSP の機能を使ってるわけじゃないのか…","ts":"1625404485.233100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sVF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41b5a844-f18c-4088-a8b2-947facf2fe40","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"たとえば「関数の引数」と「ブロック内で定義したローカル変数」は構文解析では区別できなくて、意味解析を行って初めてハイライトの区別をつけられるようになる…ということですね。\n逆に言えば、それが LSP によってできるなら、シンタックスハイライトだって（ある意味セマンティックハイライトの下位互換なので）できるような気がします。","ts":"1625404375.232700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TFW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b3329f3-904a-4b2a-af19-8afb25006464","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私も semantic token というのは知りませんでした。\nガイドの最初の数行だけ読むと、どうやら通常の（字句解析ベースの）シンタックスハイライト機構では捕捉できない、より高度なシンタックスハイライトを提供するための枠組みのようですね。\n字句解析/構文解析より高度な、意味解析で判明するような情報を使うから \"Semantic\" highlight なのか。","ts":"1625404219.231300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xBqT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3786c0c-09b3-40d3-98c0-7d4bd5629c64","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"これを見ると、確かに \u003chttps://code.visualstudio.com/api/language-extensions/semantic-highlight-guide\u003e\n\u0026gt; The editor applies the highlighting from semantic tokens on top of the highlighting from grammars.\nと書いてあって、不可能に見えました。うーん？","ts":"1625400032.229200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cm98q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17188f58-efb3-4eeb-b3a5-a12a835f8caf","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"無いとか言ってごめんなさい","ts":"1625399501.227700","thread_ts":"1625399501.227700","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"bow","count":1,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L1o4q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55953381-2ba0-4220-a38d-403de696c90d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"優勝できそう？","ts":"1625399486.227300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xpST"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aabe6d77-76ca-4afa-8ab4-59198788238e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なるほどなあ","ts":"1625399284.226900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8w3aU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83c83035-8db9-48b5-8b4a-1e3d4ee977da","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"今度試します","ts":"1625399143.226300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y+Vr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b582f17-2e90-4d51-8a65-b54a18cbe596","type":"message","user":"U012MBD7MFZ","text":"もしかして: 言語サーバでハイライトできる？ \u003chttps://zenn.dev/takl/books/0fe11c6e177223/viewer/d2d307\u003e","ts":"1625399064.225500","attachments":[{"fallback":"Zenn: Semantic Tokens｜Language Server Protocol に対応したミニ言語処理系を作る","id":1,"title":"Semantic Tokens｜Language Server Protocol に対応したミニ言語処理系を作る","title_link":"https://zenn.dev/takl/books/0fe11c6e177223/viewer/d2d307","image_url":"https://zenn.dev/images/og-large.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Zenn","service_icon":"https://zenn.dev/images/icon.png","from_url":"https://zenn.dev/takl/books/0fe11c6e177223/viewer/d2d307","original_url":"https://zenn.dev/takl/books/0fe11c6e177223/viewer/d2d307"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delet